      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1243",
      "html": "<p>Scientific name: Pangasius nasutus (Bleeker, 1863). Family: Pangasiidae. Maximum size: 90 cm SL. IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2019).</p><p>Etymology: the name Pangasius comes from a local (Bengali) name of the fish (pungas).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
