      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1243",
      "html": "<p>Asia: Greater Sunda Island rivers in Sumatra and Borneo, and Peninsular Malaysia. Type locality: Barito River, Bandjarmasin, southern Kalimantan, Borneo, Indonesia.</p>"
    },
    {
